flowchart TD
  Live[Live scenario] --> Q1{Reproduced as the user?}
  Q1 -->|No| StopGuess[Do not guess; get path and sample]
  Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Missing UI or access denied?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| AccessFirst[Treat as access first]
  Q2 -->|No| Q3{Wrong values and no error?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| DataFirst[Inspect records first]
  Q3 -->|No| Q4{Error or unexpected automation?}
  Q4 -->|Yes| EnableLog[User trace flag then read the debug log]
  Q4 -->|No| Split[Split access vs data vs automation with evidence]
